  "notes": [
    "37 GUIs across seven installed interface families. Existing MOD same-name override candidates should also be processed; no source copied or edited by this manifest.",
    "Visual inspection: /tmp/bsm-feature-chrome-sheet.png (26 source texture thumbnails). Pure mapped career panels, faction header/tab, SP neutral entry, naval HQ neutral row, MIO neutral row and blank text fields were inspected together with actual .gfx definitions.",
    "Preserve GFX_MIO_details_background (industrial photograph), GFX_projects_bg/project_output_bg (notebook artwork), GFX_sp_top_bg (colored specialty strips), GFX_faction_goals_bg (semantic columns), naval_headquarter_buildings_bg (slots), naval_headquarters_header (ships), raids launch/outcome/header composites (icons/fields/art).",
    "All remaining defined local references are conservatively preserved unless already explicitly mapped by economy.json; this is a safety inventory, not a request to revert existing Win95 assets. Parent should scope preserve to these GUI references when merging theme manifests.",
    "No light_roots supplied: C++ parent composition was not proven for backgroundless roots; do not force black fonts on unproven backgrounds.",
    "Keep profile custom backgrounds, portraits, medals/ribbons, flags, facilities/scientists/raid art, equipment icons, progressbar fills, RGB/HSV sliders, semantic markers and selected-state frames. No full icon/symbol sheets may be blanked.",
    "Preserve transparency in overlay/transparent-background sprites. MIO and naval HQ row frames retain source frame count/effects; selected/disabled state differences must remain.",
    "Generic button/icon-button references are preserved unless independently visually proven blank. Existing shared economy mappings apply where explicit; do not broad-match button/tab names.",
    "Root visually reviewed shared-role conflicts as neutral chrome: GFX_closebutton, GFX_closebutton_small, GFX_construction_province_background, GFX_div_count_bg, GFX_generic_box_smallest, GFX_hint_bg, GFX_icon_button_45x32, GFX_mini_bg, GFX_pol_goal_popup_bg, GFX_scroll_down, GFX_scroll_drager, GFX_scroll_left, GFX_scroll_right, GFX_scroll_track_horisontal, GFX_scroll_up, GFX_sort_button_100x29, GFX_sort_button_83x29. Apply the reviewed shared role in these GUIs too."
